OL,3,GNEWSAHow staying true to his roots is
OL,4,Ahelping rapper go global
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper Chiedu Oraka, who found fame
OL,7,Fsupporting Coldplay during their Hull
OL,8,Fconcert last year, says staying true to
OL,9,Fhis core beliefs, seeded on a council
OL,10,Festate, has taken him thousands of
OL,11,Fmiles from home.
OL,13,FLater, he will be the only UK artist
OL,14,Fperforming at Music Matters Live in
OL,15,FSingapore.
OL,17,FChiefu says he hopes to show the
OL,18,Fresilience, talent and ambition of his
OL,19,Fhome city to an audience on the other
OL,20,Fside of the world.
OL,22,F"It's like a dream," he says.
